<div class="home-template">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="home-hero-copy">
      <p class="home-eyebrow">前端工程师的小站</p>
      <h1>把开发中的问题、方法和判断沉淀下来</h1>
      <p class="home-subtitle">这里整理前端工程、AI 编程、JavaScript / CSS 基础、效率工具和真实项目里的问题复盘。首页先给你一张地图，再带你进入具体文章。</p>
      <div class="home-actions">
        <a class="home-action is-primary" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">浏览全部文章</a>
        <a class="home-action" href="<%- url_for('/category/') %>">按分类查看</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="home-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="visual-orbit">
        <span>AI</span>
        <span>FE</span>
        <span>CSS</span>
      </div>
      <div class="visual-terminal">
        <div class="visual-bar">
          <i></i>
          <i></i>
          <i></i>
        </div>
        <p>notes / build / debug</p>
        <strong>72 posts indexed</strong>
        <small>method -> practice -> review</small>
      </div>
      <div class="visual-flow">
        <span>Prompt</span>
        <span>Code</span>
        <span>Ship</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="home-stats" aria-label="站点概况">
      <div>
        <strong><%= site.posts.length %></strong>
        <span>篇文章</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>AI</strong>
        <span>开发成长</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>FE</strong>
        <span>前端实践</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <div class="home-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">内容方向</p>
        <h2>这座小站主要写什么</h2>
      </div>
      <p>从日常开发里抽出可复用的经验：能解决问题，也能帮助下一次更快判断。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topic-grid">
      <article class="topic-card">
        <span class="topic-index">01</span>
        <h3>AI 与开发者成长</h3>
        <p>记录 AI 编程方法、避坑经验，以及开发者在新工具时代需要继续打磨的能力。</p>
        <a href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">查看相关文章</a>
      </article>
      <article class="topic-card">
        <span class="topic-index">02</span>
        <h3>前端工程实践</h3>
        <p>沉淀项目结构、构建流程、组件组织、发布维护等工程化经验。</p>
        <a href="<%- url_for('/category/') %>">进入分类</a>
      </article>
      <article class="topic-card">
        <span class="topic-index">03</span>
        <h3>基础与浏览器</h3>
        <p>梳理 JavaScript、CSS、性能、浏览器机制等长期有用的基础知识。</p>
        <a href="<%- url_for('/tag/') %>">浏览标签</a>
      </article>
      <article class="topic-card">
        <span class="topic-index">04</span>
        <h3>工具与问题复盘</h3>
        <p>把调试、效率工具、线上问题和踩坑记录整理成下次能直接参考的清单。</p>
        <a href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">翻看归档</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <div class="home-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">最近更新</p>
        <h2>最新文章</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="section-more" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">全部归档</a>
    </div>

    <div class="latest-list">
      <% site.posts.sort('date', -1).limit(6).each(function(post){ %>
        <% var tags = post.tags && post.tags.toArray ? post.tags.toArray().slice(0, 2) : []; %>
        <a class="latest-row" href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>">
          <time datetime="<%- date(post.date, 'YYYY-MM-DD') %>"><%- date(post.date, 'YYYY.MM.DD') %></time>
          <span class="latest-title"><%- post.title %></span>
          <span class="latest-tags">
            <% if (tags.length) { %>
              <% tags.forEach(function(tag){ %>
                <em><%- tag.name %></em>
              <% }) %>
            <% } else { %>
              <em>文章</em>
            <% } %>
          </span>
        </a>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <div class="home-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">快速入口</p>
        <h2>按你的阅读方式进入</h2>
      </div>
      <p>想系统翻阅、按主题查找，或了解站点本身，都可以从这里开始。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="site-link-grid">
      <a class="site-link-card" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">
        <strong>文章归档</strong>
        <span>按时间浏览全部内容</span>
      </a>
      <a class="site-link-card" href="<%- url_for('/category/') %>">
        <strong>分类目录</strong>
        <span>按主题聚合文章</span>
      </a>
      <a class="site-link-card" href="<%- url_for('/tag/') %>">
        <strong>标签索引</strong>
        <span>用关键词快速定位</span>
      </a>
      <a class="site-link-card" href="<%- url_for('/about/') %>">
        <strong>关于我</strong>
        <span>了解作者和小站</span>
      </a>
      <a class="site-link-card" href="<%- url_for('/friends/') %>">
        <strong>友链</strong>
        <span>访问相关站点</span>
      </a>
      <a class="site-link-card" href="<%- url_for('/ins/') %>">
        <strong>相册</strong>
        <span>查看图片记录</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
